@@ -3,3 +3,10 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental service
+
+`createRentalService()` provides an in-memory rental service. Add boards or sails with an integer-cent
+daily price, then use `quote` or `book` with UTC ISO-8601 midnight boundaries. Rental periods are
+half-open: the `end` is midnight at the start of the day after the final rental day. Bookings for the
+same item may be adjacent but cannot overlap.
